  "notes": [
    "Targets are the Gearbox linear pools the anchor executed; the composable bb-g-USD only consumed the inflated rate. Recovery mode, switched on days before, is an emergency state like a pause, not a reset (rule 10). The Aave-pool tx this record was first filed under is in the campaign.",
    "Beethoven X (Fantom) is included: its first drain came 22 minutes after the anchor and its attack contracts share about half their opcode 12-grams with the Ethereum attacker's, as much as those share with each other; a second EOA deployed byte-identical code.",
    "Loss nets each tx's Vault flows per underlying, converting static aTokens, Gearbox, Idle, Yearn, Reaper and Overnight wrappers and kept linear BPT at the pool's pre-tx rate; burned BPT is skipped. Unpriced Multichain DAI/USDC on Fantom: attacker's realised 0.197 WFTM/DAI, pool spot 0.498 WFTM/USDC."
  ]
